title: The Trapped Aisle
portrait left: seeker

A narrow aisle, and something glinting at the far end. The floor is a chessboard of slightly loose flagstones.

choice:
  - Push through (take 12 damage, take the relic) -> push
  - Sneak (a coin flip) -> sneak
  - Go around -> leave

@push
  > hp -12
  > relic random uncommon
  Every third stone bites. You reach the end bleeding and holding something worth it.
  > end

@sneak
  > flag set sneak-roll
  You step, and step, and step. Nothing happens. Nothing happens. The glint is gone; someone else was sneakier.
  > gold 20
  > end

@leave
  You take the long way. It is long.
  > end
